# Cyrillic roots the retail list guards only with  boundaries - the client's regex engine
# cannot fire  next to a non-ASCII character, so those retail roots never match. The line
# below re-covers them with look-around boundaries instead (lookbehind/lookahead work).
(?<![а-яёa-z0-9])(х+у+[еийюяё]|манд(?:а|ой|е|у|ы)(?![а-яё])|сук(?:а|е|у|и)(?![а-яё])|ёб(?:ну|н|т|а|ы)(?![а-яё])|еб(?:ать|ал|ла|ля|ло|у)(?![а-яё]))

